    "title": "Coroner identifies man dead after being hit by car in Wyoming - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Julia Priest ,\n1 hours ago\nWYOMING, LUZERNE COUNTY (WBRE/WYOU) — 28/22 News now knows the name of the man killed after being hit by a car while trying to cross the street in Luzerne County.\nThe coroner says 85-year-old Alexander Paulowsky was hit on Wyoming Avenue in Wyoming on Monday afternoon .\nDriver seriously injured after fiery crash Officers say Paulowsky was taken to the hospital, where he later died from his injuries.\nThere is no word on if any charges may be filed.\nCopyright 2025 Nexstar Media, Inc. All rights reserved. This material may not be published, broadcast, rewritten, or redistributed. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to 28/22 News.",
